  <!-- TRAPS -->
  <section class="section section-alt traps-start" id="traps">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div>
          <p class="section-kicker">06 · Bẫy đề</p>
          <h2>Mười lỗi hay mất điểm.</h2>
          <p>Xem câu sai, câu đúng và lý do. Đây là những lỗi học sinh lớp 9 hay mắc nhất khi làm phần từ loại.</p>
        </div>
        <p class="section-aside"><span>10</span> lỗi<br>cần sửa</p>
      </div>

      <div class="trap-grid">
        <article class="trap">
          <div class="trap-line trap-line-bad"><span class="trap-mark" aria-hidden="true">✗</span><p><span class="sr-only">Sai: </span>I am very <strong>interesting</strong> in music.</p></div>
          <div class="trap-line trap-line-good"><span class="trap-mark" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><p><span class="sr-only">Đúng: </span>I am very <strong>interested</strong> in music.</p></div>
          <p class="trap-why">Người cảm thấy → -ed; vật/việc gây cảm giác → -ing.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="trap">
          <div class="trap-line trap-line-bad"><span class="trap-mark" aria-hidden="true">✗</span><p><span class="sr-only">Sai: </span>The film was so <strong>bored</strong> that we fell asleep.</p></div>
          <div class="trap-line trap-line-good"><span class="trap-mark" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><p><span class="sr-only">Đúng: </span>The film was so <strong>boring</strong> that we fell asleep.</p></div>
          <p class="trap-why">Bộ phim gây cảm giác buồn chán → boring. Người cảm thấy buồn chán → bored.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="trap">
          <div class="trap-line trap-line-bad"><span class="trap-mark" aria-hidden="true">✗</span><p><span class="sr-only">Sai: </span>She gave me a good <strong>advise</strong>.</p></div>
          <div class="trap-line trap-line-good"><span class="trap-mark" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><p><span class="sr-only">Đúng: </span>She gave me a good <strong>advice</strong>.</p></div>
          <p class="trap-why">advice là danh từ không đếm được; advise là động từ: She advised me to study.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="trap">
          <div class="trap-line trap-line-bad"><span class="trap-mark" aria-hidden="true">✗</span><p><span class="sr-only">Sai: </span>The weather <strong>effects</strong> my mood.</p></div>
          <div class="trap-line trap-line-good"><span class="trap-mark" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><p><span class="sr-only">Đúng: </span>The weather <strong>affects</strong> my mood.</p></div>
          <p class="trap-why">affect là động từ (ảnh hưởng); effect là danh từ (tác động): the effect of the weather.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="trap">
          <div class="trap-line trap-line-bad"><span class="trap-mark" aria-hidden="true">✗</span><p><span class="sr-only">Sai: </span>He is a <strong>success</strong> businessman.</p></div>
          <div class="trap-line trap-line-good"><span class="trap-mark" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><p><span class="sr-only">Đúng: </span>He is a <strong>successful</strong> businessman.</p></div>
          <p class="trap-why">Trước danh từ businessman cần tính từ successful, không dùng danh từ success.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="trap">
          <div class="trap-line trap-line-bad"><span class="trap-mark" aria-hidden="true">✗</span><p><span class="sr-only">Sai: </span>We need a more <strong>economic</strong> car.</p></div>
          <div class="trap-line trap-line-good"><span class="trap-mark" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><p><span class="sr-only">Đúng: </span>We need a more <strong>economical</strong> car.</p></div>
          <p class="trap-why">economic = thuộc kinh tế; economical = tiết kiệm, ít tốn kém.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="trap">
          <div class="trap-line trap-line-bad"><span class="trap-mark" aria-hidden="true">✗</span><p><span class="sr-only">Sai: </span>She studies very <strong>hardly</strong>.</p></div>
          <div class="trap-line trap-line-good"><span class="trap-mark" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><p><span class="sr-only">Đúng: </span>She studies very <strong>hard</strong>.</p></div>
          <p class="trap-why">hard = chăm chỉ; hardly = hầu như không. Đừng thêm -ly vào hard khi muốn nói “chăm chỉ”.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="trap">
          <div class="trap-line trap-line-bad"><span class="trap-mark" aria-hidden="true">✗</span><p><span class="sr-only">Sai: </span>He came <strong>lately</strong> yesterday.</p></div>
          <div class="trap-line trap-line-good"><span class="trap-mark" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><p><span class="sr-only">Đúng: </span>He came <strong>late</strong> yesterday.</p></div>
          <p class="trap-why">late = muộn; lately = gần đây. “Yesterday” cần late, không phải lately.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="trap">
          <div class="trap-line trap-line-bad"><span class="trap-mark" aria-hidden="true">✗</span><p><span class="sr-only">Sai: </span>She speaks very <strong>friendly</strong>.</p></div>
          <div class="trap-line trap-line-good"><span class="trap-mark" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><p><span class="sr-only">Đúng: </span>She speaks <strong>in a friendly way</strong>.</p></div>
          <p class="trap-why">friendly là tính từ, không phải trạng từ. Muốn bổ nghĩa cho động từ, dùng “in a friendly way”.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="trap">
          <div class="trap-line trap-line-bad"><span class="trap-mark" aria-hidden="true">✗</span><p><span class="sr-only">Sai: </span>She sings very <strong>good</strong>.</p></div>
          <div class="trap-line trap-line-good"><span class="trap-mark" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><p><span class="sr-only">Đúng: </span>She sings very <strong>well</strong>.</p></div>
          <p class="trap-why">good là tính từ; well là trạng từ bất quy tắc của good.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

